450331,36.114103,0 -115.450263,36.113816,0 -115.45024,36.113686,0 -115.450242,36.113252,0 -115.4503113,36.1121378,0 -115.4503119,36.112097,0 -115.4503228,36.1119149,0 -115.4502853,36.1117473,0 -115.4502013,36.1115961,0 -115.4501101,36.1114921,0 -115.4500185,36.1114062,0 -115.4499196,36.1113531,0 -115.4498848,36.1113339,0 -115.4497935,36.1112973,0 -115.4497507,36.1112798,0 -115.449726,36.1112722,0 -115.4497024,36.1112646,0 -115.4496308,36.1112381,0 -115.4495536,36.1112104,0 -115.4495236,36.1112004,0 -115.4492917,36.1111429,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kraft Mountain Parking</name><description>Designated gravel parking area at the end of Sandstone Drive. Start here for Kraft bouldering; reached via Calico Basin Road, outside the Scenic Drive. Follow the established trail east toward the main boulders. Pin marks the parking lot, not a specific space. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/255587420</description><Point><coordinates>-115.42106868,36.15679822,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>23. Wall of Confusion</name><description>Park at P2 (Second Pullout / Calico II). Follow the Gallery approach, then head left at the climbing. Sunny wall with 10 sport routes; American Sportsman 5.10b, Super Guide 5.11a, Desert Pickle 5.11c, Makalu 5.11d, and Fear and Loathing III 5.12a. Source: https://www.mountainproject.com/area/105808903/wall-of-confusion</description><Point><coordinates>-115.4392,36.15727,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P2. Second Pullout / Calico II</name><description>Use this lot for the Gallery, Sweet Pain Wall, Black Corridor and Wall of Confusion. Spaces are limited; park only in designated spaces. The Scenic Drive is one-way. First Pullout (P1) is an earlier parking option, not a lot you can drive back to directly. Source: https://www.mountainproject.com/area/105731980/second-pullout-calico-ii</description><Point><coordinates>-115.4375212,36.15182479,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P1. First Pullout / Calico I</name><description>Alternative when you expect Second Pullout to be full: park here BEFORE continuing along the one-way drive. From the northwest end of the lot, follow the dirt trail alongside the road toward Second Pullout: approximately 0.4 miles / 10 extra minutes per Mountain Project. This is additional to the crag approach. Source: https://www.mountainproject.com/area/105731980/second-pullout-calico-ii</description><Point><coordinates>-115.43165411,36.14648348,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kraft approach trail — eastern trailhead to Americana vicinity</name><description>Mapped portion of Kraft Mountain Loop Trail, OpenStreetMap way 315369605. Starts at east side of Kraft parking, not the visitor center. Does not include final paths to individual boulders. Retrieved September 20, 2026.</description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff2663bd</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style><LineString><coordinates>-115.4202729,36.1568034,0 -115.4202475,36.1568856,0 -115.4202424,36.1569738,0 -115.4201981,36.1570356,0 -115.4201673,36.1570702,0 -115.420146,36.1571193,0 -115.4201413,36.1572093,0 -115.4201659,36.1573306,0 -115.4201554,36.1574008,0 -115.4201577,36.1574283,0 -115.4201671,36.157487,0 -115.4201788,36.157506,0 -115.4201741,36.1575354,0 -115.4201906,36.1575695,0 -115.420202,36.1576015,0 -115.4202199,36.1576426,0 -115.4202415,36.1576768,0 -115.4202424,36.157716,0 -115.420222,36.1577393,0 -115.4201937,36.1577495,0 -115.4201367,36.1577576,0 -115.4200915,36.1577664,0 -115.4200578,36.1578045,0 -115.420045,36.1578404,0 -115.4200587,36.1578849,0 -115.4200823,36.1579476,0 -115.4200597,36.1580141,0 -115.4200614,36.1585852,0 -115.4200762,36.1587124,0 -115.4201092,36.1587887,0 -115.4201187,36.158866,0 -115.4200965,36.1589448,0 -115.4199987,36.1590786,0 -115.419808,36.1591632,0 -115.4197445,36.1591663,0 -115.4197004,36.159194,0 -115.4197116,36.1592452,0 -115.4196526,36.1593004,0 -115.4195439,36.1593806,0 -115.4193292,3